# Marlowe Job Execution

- Submit Marlowe benchmark/evaluation runs via Slurm with `sbatch`; do not run long eval commands directly on login nodes.
- Prefer existing wrappers in `scripts/slurm/` and pass runtime settings via `sbatch --export` or wrapper env vars.
- When providing run instructions, include:
  - `cd /projects/m000102/code/levante-bench`
  - `git pull`
  - the exact `sbatch`/wrapper command to submit
- For quick checks, keep direct runs limited to lightweight diagnostics only (no full benchmark tasks).
